L["Every item tooltip in the game gets AME's block: which auction house the prices come from and how fresh they are, the market price, and for gear what disenchanting it is worth (its materials at what selling them nets, as the DE signal counts them). Own more than one? Each price shows per item and, on the right, for all of yours - with what a vendor pays for them all. Under that: how many you have and where (bags, bank, mailbox, guild banks), how many you have up for sale on the AH, what the ones in your bags and bank are worth at the market price (handy for knowing when you've farmed enough), how it trades against its average, and the signal with its reason: what price and supply are doing, or for DE and VENDOR how much disenchanting or a vendor beats listing it."] = true
