L["The Crafting tab is everything about professions: your characters' professions, who can make what, the craft queue, what your recipes earn at today's prices, and how to level up. Pick a page in the sidebar; the character, profession and search filters on the toolbar stay as you switch pages. AME learns your recipes from your profession windows: open each profession once on every character. Recipe data comes with AME in the AME Crafting Data addon, loaded only when you use the tab; Recipes to buy and Leveling need it."] = true
L["The Overview is the whole auction house at a glance, like a stock exchange's indexes: is the market getting dearer or cheaper, how much is listed, and where the gold is. It's off by default: switch it on under Settings, General, and Overview appears next to Screener on the Market tab's toolbar. Market data takes a little longer to update while it's on."] = true
